[ti:Allah wakbar]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Tamsalt n Sliman]
[length:3:14]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:01.16] Ass mi d-teqseqsa lehna
[00:06.28] Nerra-tt si lḥaṛa
[00:08.88] Nenna-as aql-aɣ labas
[00:17.98] Nerwa lxir d lbaraka
[00:22.87] Ur aɣ-ixuss wara
[00:25.26] Ad yekkes ayen nettu yiwen wass
[00:34.26] Tezzint wallen ɣer lqebla
[00:38.68] Am wakken i as-yenna
[00:41.16] Ad d-iwwet ubeḥri n tissas
[00:45.58] Allah wakber, allah
[00:55.17]
[01:06.20] Taɛṛabt d awal n ṛebbi
[01:10.65] Deg-s tamussni
[01:12.98] Mačči am tigad niḑen
[01:22.04] Fell-as ma tuwḑeḑ s ifri
[01:26.50] Xas grireb ɣli
[01:29.00] D muḥemmed ara k-id-isellken
[01:37.62] Ḥader ad ak-id-yeldi yiẓṛi
[01:42.00] Qqar kan sidi
[01:44.56] I widen k-izzuzunen
[01:49.10] Allah wakber, allah
[01:58.47]
[02:09.19] Ḥader ad d-takiḑ si tnafa
[02:13.79] Aql-ik di lxelwa
[02:16.42] Asebsi n lkif d arfiq-ik
[02:25.09] Ttmuqul kan lqebla
[02:29.91] D lkeɛba ccrifa
[02:32.23] D nutni i d tafat-ik
[02:40.76] Kkat aqerru-k di lqaɛa
[02:45.35] Ur ssemḥas ara
[02:47.57] Sel kan i sidi ccix-ik
[02:52.35] Allah wakber, allah
[03:02.01] Allah wakber, allah
